# The Road to Divadom (jeuno 97) for a level 75 Warrior with The Unfinished Waltz completed: the job alone fails check 1
# (not offered: the Waltz's 10134). Accepted by a GM, the job alone fails check 2 (the accepted section needs a
# Dancer): Laila again 10134 and Rhea the Waltz's 10135, and Jugner Forest [S] entered at Prog 0 plays no 105.
lists UpperJeuno/Laila/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Rhea_Myuliah/onTrigger JugnerForestS/onZoneIn/1
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-52.5,0,101 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.LakesideMinuet completed
quest Jeuno.TheUnfinishedWaltz completed
login
trigger Laila                           # not a Dancer: no section; the Waltz's 10134
finish
quest Jeuno.TheRoadToDivadom accepted
trigger Laila                           # accepted, not a Dancer: no section; 10134
finish
trigger Rhea_Myuliah                    # 10135
finish
warp 99,6.4,442.6 JugnerForestS         # not a Dancer: no zone-in event
